WEBVTT

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.000
Callouses on my knees
that let me kneel comfortably.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.976
Leathery chest pads that beat the heat.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.000
Short fur that keeps my skin cool.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.141
Long legs that allow heat to escape.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.510
And my hump?

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.976
Ogden Nash once wrote:

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.239
"The camel has a single hump;
the dromedary two,

00:13:22.263 --> 00:13:24.976
or else the other way around.
I'm never sure. Are you?"

00:13:25.899 --> 00:13:26.976
Here's a hint:

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.976
Bactarian.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.000
Dromedary.